      "text": "Policy-optimization hyperparameters.\nThe standardized attn-fa2 reruns use Qwen/\nQwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct as the policy. We train LoRA adapters with rank 8 and LoRA\nalpha 16 on all linear layers, with gradient checkpointing enabled. The actor optimizer\nis AdamW with learning rate 10\u22125, weight decay 0.01, betas (0.9, 0.999), a constant\n",
